WEBVTT

00:01:28.459 --> 00:01:33.840
Tonight, you can use your powers to swap
up to six pairs of camps

00:01:33.840 --> 00:01:38.928
that are horizontally, vertically,
or diagonally adjacent.

00:01:38.928 --> 00:01:42.098
No camp can be moved more than once.

00:01:42.640 --> 00:01:45.893
Which swaps do you make
to keep the peace?

00:01:45.893 --> 00:01:48.312
Pause here to figure it out yourself.
Answer in 3

00:01:48.312 --> 00:01:50.606
Answer in 2

00:01:50.606 --> 00:01:53.109
Answer in 1

00:01:53.234 --> 00:01:58.156
The first insight here is to divide
this into two sub-problems.

00:01:58.281 --> 00:02:01.409
There’s the matter of connecting 
4 clumps of Greeks